     "caption": "\"Hi folks -- today I'm going to teach you how to peel a potato perfectly in less than 10 seconds. This skill will prepare you for when the global economy collapses at the hands of the Jews and the lizard people emerge from their ten thousand year slumber to take over the world.\""
